    "sections": {
        "description": "The Classic Attorney is a sleek, professional, and responsive website template designed specifically for legal professionals. Whether you're a trial lawyer, corporate attorney, or legal consultant, this theme provides a modern and trustworthy foundation for your firm’s online presence. It includes well-organized pages for showcasing services, attorney bios, case results, FAQs, and blog content. Features like an appointment booking system, contact form, testimonial carousel, and intuitive navigation enhance client engagement and trust. With a clean layout, bold typography, and SEO-friendly structure, Classic Attorney helps law firms present their expertise with credibility and ease."
    },
